    <s:String x:Key="S.Warn.NoCaptureMetadata">{0} file(s) without capture metadata — the file system timestamp was used, and that says when the file was copied, not when the photo was taken.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S.Warn.DateFromFileName">{0} file(s) carry no capture metadata, but their name does — the date was read from the file name (messenger images, screenshots).</s:String>
