    <s:String x:Key="S.Warn.WideHomeZone">Zone "{0}" is marked as home and reaches {1:0.#} km — everything inside it counts as everyday life, never as a trip. Change its kind or its radius if that is not what you meant.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="S.Warn.EverydayFolders">{0} group(s) inside a home zone went into these dateless folders: {1}. Without the model there is nothing to tell one day at home from another. A zone of kind "home" is everyday life — check its kind if a folder here should not be.</s:String>
